---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /tags/
pageTitle: 标签
---
<section class="intro">
  <h1>标签</h1>
  <p>按标签浏览，括号内为人数。</p>
</section>
{% if collections.tagMap.length %}
<p class="chips chips-lg">
  {%- for t in collections.tagMap %}<a class="chip" href="{{ ('/tags/' + t.name + '/') | url }}">{{ t.name }}<small>{{ t.items.length }}</small></a>{% endfor %}
</p>
{% else %}
<p class="empty">暂无标签。</p>
{% endif %}
